  "$comment": [
    "Recorded answers from a real POST /detect against meco-faces, for the three",
    "fixture photographs that have faces in them. Checked in so that meco's own",
    "tests can frame a Crop on a real detection without loading ONNX Runtime,",
    "reaching the network, or depending on a second workspace package.",
    "This is a recording, not a claim about the detector: what guards the",
    "detector is packages/faces `pnpm test:detect`, which measures it against the",
    "hand-marked boxes in expected.json beside this file. Every number is a",
    "fraction of the image, rounded to six decimals.",
    "Re-record with `pnpm --filter meco-faces dump:detected`."
